{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"glass-worriless-mammal","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Problem\nThe live Jira DC harness test tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_store_copy_isolation.py::test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed FAILS on current main:\n\n  AssertionError: binding/snapshot artifacts survived the scrub: ['.bridge_state']\n  assert ['.bridge_state'] == []\n\nObserved in the 'jira DC harness smoke' job of Live External Integration run 31807853902 (job 94790999602), 2026-08-14, against origin/main. The store-copy scrub step (from J11 / nonmystic-topiary-toadfish, epic e369) does not remove the .bridge_state directory, so a binding/snapshot artifact survives into the copied store the test asserts is fully scrubbed. Likely related to recent .bridge_state cache work (epic 0303).\n\n## Impact\nIndependent of the rich-text epic (vigilant-erasable-pony) — surfaced while running that epic's live DC-harness job. It makes the DC-harness job red on an unrelated cell, muddying the live signal for other work.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The store-copy scrub removes .bridge_state (and any equivalent binding/snapshot cache) so test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed passes in the live DC-harness job.\n- [ ] A root-cause note explains why .bridge_state began surviving the scrub (regression origin).\n\n## Notes\nDiscovered during orchestration of vigilant-erasable-pony's operator-dispatched live run; NOT a blocker for graywolf (whose own rich-text test is tracked separately).","id":"91aa-167f-1061-4f17","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live DC store-copy scrub leaves .bridge_state behind (test_store_copy_isolation regression)"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786720415815192001,"uuid":"2c36c666-0c99-4ced-9fa6-595ea131a685"}